    "description": "With this ticket, you’ll have skip-the-line access to the Recinte Modernista de Sant Pau museum. \r\n\r\nAt this former hospital, you’ll be able to see one of the world’s largest Art Nouveau collections. You’ll be able to learn about the design and history of this building as you explore the art works of the interior. At the museum, you’ll visit the Sant Salvador Pavilion where you’ll learn about the building’s long history as a hospital. You’ll also be able to see a tribute to Lluís Domènech i Montaner – a major Art Nouveau architect in the Catalan region.",
