            "numericRating": 5,
            "content": "The original hospital with multiple buildings of amazing  architecture. Beautiful mosaics and tiled underground passageways which were used to move patients from one building to another. I’d recommend utilising the audio tour and allowing over an hour.\nHop on hop off bus Green line stop 12 is right outside.",
